  "contentData": [
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentItemTitle": "Zo gaat de behandeling",
      "contentTypeKey": "73fd841a-758a-4e00-8f71-eeeab3cb9cfd",
      "udi": "umb://element/6945dcfcc5a74be382c569c38caaa30a"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentItemContentText": {
        "markup": "<p>Zou zo maar kunnen.</p>\n<h3><span class=\"highlighted\">We doen nog een kopje 3 - gewoon omdat het kan</span></h3>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "contentItemTitle": "Kan ik hier aan doodgaan?",
      "contentTypeKey": "73fd841a-758a-4e00-8f71-eeeab3cb9cfd",
      "udi": "umb://element/2ac8bcd5895e41ac84a488cd74dd1fa3"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentItemContentText": {
        "markup": "<p>Ook prima. <a href=\"https://www.amc.nl/web/home.htm\">Ziekenhuizen genoeg</a>.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "contentItemTitle": "Maar ik word liever behandeld",
      "contentTypeKey": "73fd841a-758a-4e00-8f71-eeeab3cb9cfd",
      "udi": "umb://element/971bd8f5d37b4231a73fbb72efec2a12"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentItemContentText": {
        "markup": "<div class=\"mceNonEditable embeditem\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wz5wZk8uRYA\" data-embed-height=\"240\" data-embed-width=\"360\" data-embed-constrain=\"true\"><iframe width=\"360\" height=\"203\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Wz5wZk8uRYA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<p> </p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "contentTypeKey": "73fd841a-758a-4e00-8f71-eeeab3cb9cfd",
      "udi": "umb://element/aa0170124b7542449c9da29b7e18546c"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentItemContentText": {
        "markup": "<p>Mocht iemand Nijntje niet kennen, dan vertellen we dat hier even...</p>\n<div class=\"mceNonEditable embeditem\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y0JvzVEOVJM\" data-embed-height=\"318\" data-embed-width=\"664\" data-embed-constrain=\"false\"><iframe width=\"565\" height=\"318\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/y0JvzVEOVJM?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<p> </p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "contentItemTitle": "Nijntje is de allerleukste",
      "contentTypeKey": "73fd841a-758a-4e00-8f71-eeeab3cb9cfd",
      "udi": "umb://element/3c7b03bc377d4a16a01f4ea5dabd0235"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "6392fb73-e9d7-47de-99b1-f3262e9fc9dc",
      "image": [
        {
          "key": "c881d2ef-9850-46b3-afc4-4e7343b58d67",
          "mediaKey": "30a37439-8fba-4bad-a676-34b5400244c6"
        }
      ],
      "imagePosition": "Rechts",
      "imageText": {
        "markup": "<p>en</p>\n<p>dan </p>\n<p>kom</p>\n<p>hier dus <br />een ellenlang</p>\n<p>verhaal</p>\n<p>over</p>\n<p>van </p>\n<p>alles en</p>\n<p>nog wat</p>\n<p>en dan</p>\n<p>ga je </p>\n<p>je </p>\n<p>toch</p>\n<p>afvragen</p>\n<p>hoe dat er</p>\n<p>uit </p>\n<p>komt </p>\n<p>te zien </p>\n<p>op </p>\n<p>het scherm</p>\n<p>waarom staat dit eigenlijk sowieso niet dichter op elkaar? komt dat omdat ik een harde enter gebruik ipv dat ik gewoon doortyp?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/4b527833fe344b51b674efa33c3abbb5"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "6392fb73-e9d7-47de-99b1-f3262e9fc9dc",
      "image": [
        {
          "key": "45464702-43e2-419e-8a00-36d159c62cb6",
          "mediaKey": "b9eeba27-93a5-44ac-bd60-45cacf3fc54e"
        }
      ],
      "imagePosition": "Links",
      "imageText": {
        "markup": "<p><span>Het is druk in OLVG. Hierdoor moet u soms even wachten voordat wij u telefonisch te woord kunnen staan. Ook zijn de wachttijden op de polikliniek langer dan u van ons gewend bent. Onze excuses hiervoor. </span><span>Wij werken er hard aan om dit te verbeteren en om u zo snel mogelijk van dienst te zijn. Door een tekort aan personeel lukt dit niet altijd zo snel als we zelf zouden willen. </span></p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/9a57dd070f98415382e27519bc0b226a"
    },
    {
      "backgroundImage": [],
      "contentTypeKey": "6392fb73-e9d7-47de-99b1-f3262e9fc9dc",
      "image": [
        {
          "key": "debd80d2-f698-4252-817c-69c0fae3316b",
          "mediaKey": "6f1d5171-120c-469e-8177-74f90508b595"
        }
      ],
      "imagePosition": "Centreren",
      "imageText": {
        "markup": "<p>Waarom verhuist de tekst nu ook mee naar het midden?</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/2c8efb5b467c412d90915234ab3787ea"
    },
